I. Statement of Intent

This filing is intended to protect public access to fundamental computing logic used in Bitcoin-native timestamping, identity, and cryptographic signature systems.

No patent, license, or control is sought.
This is a Declaration of Prior Art and Nullification under global IP doctrine.


---

II. Scope of Declaration

This declaration applies to the use of conditional logic structures including, but not limited to:

if (condition) then { execute } else { execute }

All logical branching used in:

Blockchain timestamping

UTXO resolution

Identity verification (SATs-JWT,wave structure wave\X.)
