Relativistic or harmonic time logic (t^α, π, φ^n, θ_axial)



These elements are hereby declared unpatentable in abstract, unless materially supported by unique harmonic physical constants.


---

III. Physical and Harmonic Basis Required

Any patent claim must demonstrate material application of:

π (Pi)

φ^n (Golden ratio exponentiation)

t^α (Relativistic time shift)

θ_axial (Earth axial correction)

c (Speed of light constant)

168.e07 (harmonic east–west energy offset vector)


Failure to demonstrate material distinction or non-obvious extension renders the claim null and void under this declaration.


