IV. Chain Restriction

This prior art explicitly applies to Bitcoin (BTC) and Bitcoin-native derivations only.

It excludes all uses of BSV, Bitcoin SV, or any derivative fork claimed or influenced by Craig Steven Wright (CSW), which are hereby not recognized as valid implementations of timestamp logic.


